<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB ups SBC '97 estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB ups SBC '97 estimate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Friday it raised its 1997 earnings per share estimate for Swiss banking group Swiss Bank Corp by 12 percent but repeated a &quot;hold&quot; rating on the stock.</p>
<p>CSFB analyst Madeleine Hofmann said she expected a good performance this year in private banking, asset management and investment banking, but expected income in those areas to stagnate or even decline in 1998.</p>
<p>She raised her EPS estimate to 24.5 francs per share for 1997 but kept her 1998 estimate at 24.6 francs.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
